CONCEPTUAL PROVENANCE
The five inquiry modes motivating the operator interpretation—
Clarifying, Causal, Ethical, Transformational, and Meta—originate in
the author's The Spiral Question Ladder: See Differently. Think Deeper.
Redesign Everything. The mathematical definitions, theorems, metrics,
trajectory geometry, representation-robustness analyses, and empirical
validation constituting Spiral Inquiry Geometry are developed in the
associated research work.

